  id: mech_brood_director
  displayName: Mech Brood Director
  description: "In a Kin ruin that was a pre-corruption automation lab. The Director
    was a Kin engineer who tried to fight Vord with automation \u2014 and lost."
  tier: 1
  family: 0
  behaviors:
  - "Constructs minions live during the fight \u2014 pulls scrap from the floor."
  - "Has 4 'construction stations' around the arena \u2014 destroy them to slow spawns."
  - "Heavy ranged focus \u2014 keeps distance."
  - Repairs itself if left alone for too long.
  abilities:
  - "Drone Assembly \u2014 every 12 seconds, builds a new minion"
  - "Servo Strike \u2014 long-arm melee from range"
  - "Self-Repair \u2014 channels for 4 seconds, heals 15% HP"
  - "Overload Discharge \u2014 AOE pulse from the chest"
  dropItemIds:
  - Director's Cortex (prestige etcher recipe)
  - Servo x6, Capacitor x4
  - Heart Fragment (1 of 7)
  - Spirit Anchor
